// AI opponent tuning. Change "active" to Easy, Normal or Hard, or edit a preset's numbers.
//
// How attacks work (TUNING):
//  - No attacks during the peace window (peaceSeconds).
//  - Then attack size = firstWaveSoldiers + waveSoldiersPerMinute x aggression x strategy x (1 + provocation) x minutes,
//    and the time between attacks shrinks from firstWaveIntervalSeconds towards minWaveIntervalSeconds.
//  - Attacks up to raidMaxSoldiers are raids on your economy; bigger ones gather at a staging point and assault together.
//  - Provocation: your Soldiers in the AI's town make it escalate faster (double before earlyProvocationSeconds), capped.
//  - Each match the AI picks a strategy (weighted): Economy (boom, small early raids, faster growth later)
//    or Rush (early Barracks, bigger early attacks, slower growth later).
